messages "Harn\n**\nSubj: Piuru\n\nCc: tiamat\nDate: Jan 18\n\nPieureJDals;jd\njldjas;djas\ndjasd\nsd\nsa\nd\nsd\nasd\nsd\nsdf\ndas\nsda\nsda\nsda\nsd\ndassad\nsd\nsda\nds\nd\nasd\nsda\nsd\nsdas\nd5sd\nsd\nad\nsa\n\nd\na\ns\nsd\nsd\ndsadsa\n-*sda\n-asd\nsa\ns\nsda\nds\nsd\nsd\nasd\ns\nd**\n\n**\nHarn\n**\nSubj: Piuru\n\nCc: tiamat\nDate: Jan 18\n\nPieureJDals;jd\njldjas;djas\ndjasd\nsd\nsa\nd\nsd\nasd\nsd\nsdf\ndas\nsda\nsda\nsda\nsd\ndassad\nsd\nsda\nds\nd\nasd\nsda\nsd\nsdas\nd5sd\nsd\nad\nsa\n\nd\na\ns\nsd\nsd\ndsadsa\n-*sda\n-asd\nsa\ns\nsda\nds\nsd\nsd\nasd\ns\nd**\n\n**\nProge\n**\nSubj: heh\n\nDate: Mar 15\n\nvai ettniin... n鋣tti toimivan...\n\n**\nProge\n**\nSubj: Quo vadis?\n\nDate: Mar 15\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTermos, en asu hesassa vaan Sodankyl鋝s\nSe on se tuppukylkeskellLappia.\nT鰇k滗t vaan sormen siihen minkarvelet olenvan keskellLappia\nniin varmaan osuu.\nOn t滗 k鋞ev鋗pi, mut ku pit滗 olla\nPostissa jos haluu lukea t滗n.\nK鋣 muuten kattoon bulletin boardia tuola\ninnissja samalla pist鋅n'look at proge on plaque'\nMINTEIN SEN!\n\nProgeressively yours,\nProge\n\np.s. T滗 on parempi ku muut MUDit sanokoot ne mithaluaa.\n\n**\nSpirum\n**\nSubj: rhhoo\n\nCc: **\nDate: Dec  4\n\nnoni, rahat tuli. 1500 niinku sovittiin\n\n**\n"
